# Repo layout

- Put algorithm changes in `src/_skimage2/` (Python + Cython/C/Pythran).
- `src/skimage/` is mostly re-exports from `_skimage2`, but a few files contain real logic (e.g. `future/trainable_segmentation.py`, `util/_backends.py`).
- `src/skimage2/` is the experimental v2 API; it is almost only shims to `_skimage2`.
- Before editing `src/skimage/` or `src/skimage2/`, check whether the file is a pure re-export/shim (imports from `_skimage2` only, defines nothing of its own) or already has its own logic.
- Tests live only under top-level `tests/`, never next to source.
- Use `tests/skimage/` for the legacy API; `tests/skimage2/` for `skimage2` and `_skimage2` internals.
- After changing `.pyx` / extensions under `_skimage2`, rebuild (Meson/`spin`).
